[32m+[m[32m## Troubleshooting[m
[32m+[m[32mSee **START_HERE.md**. The most common issue is a stale project folder: Vite reports[m
[32m+[m[32m`Failed to resolve import "./pages/SecureFolder"` when the folder was extracted over an older copy.[m
[32m+[m[32mDelete the folder, re-extract the ZIP into a clean path, then `npm install && npm run dev`.[m
[32m+[m[32m`npm run doctor` names every missing file instead of showing Vite's overlay.[m
